                             Zeus TimeStats

                                   v1.0

                            ©1996 by Rod Schnell


Description
~~~~~~~~~~~
  A Zdoor that displays an ANSI BBS usage graph based on the daily average
  number of minutes users are online per hour. Basically, it is an online
  version of the GUI TimeStat utility.


Usage
~~~~~
  TimeStats is a Zdoor and takes one required argument, the linenumber.

	Syntax: TimeStats <LINENUMBER>
	

Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Example menu entry...
  
    Option_C:
    RIPReset
    ClrScr
    ZDoor '"TimeStats 'Line'"'
    Signal MenuLoop


History
~~~~~~~
  v1.0 - First version, released 14-May-96.


